      "question": "Expand: (2x - y + z)²",
      "finalAnswer": "4x^2 + y^2 + z^2 - 4xy - 2yz + 4xz",
      "solutionSteps": [
        "Use identity (a+b+c)² = a² + b² + c² + 2(ab+bc+ca).",
        "Here a=2x, b=-y, c=z.",
        "= (2x)² + (-y)² + (z)² + 2(2x)(-y) + 2(-y)(z) + 2(z)(2x).",
        "= 4x² + y² + z² - 4xy - 2yz + 4xz."
      ]
